<title>PS168 · Privacy policy</title>
<style>body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Noto Sans Khmer',sans-serif;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px 48px;line-height:1.7;color:#111827;background:#fff}h1{font-size:1.6rem;margin:0 0 4px}h2{font-size:1.15rem;margin:28px 0 6px}.en{color:#6b7280;font-size:.95em}.updated{color:#6b7280}li{margin:4px 0}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{background:#0a0a0a;color:#f3f4f6}.en,.updated{color:#9ca3af}}</style>
